</ul>
<p>Jennings adds: &#8220;A final point worth considering is that hiring trends come and go, and this analysis is not future-facing/predictive. Yet, the headline success of those in Value Theory and History &amp; Traditions appears to be consistent across past analyses.&#8221;</p><p>The post <a href="https://dailynous.com/2026/09/08/placement-aos/">Placement & AOS</a> first appeared on <a href="https://dailynous.com">Daily Nous</a>.</p>